WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.409 --> 00:00:13.980
More than a third of the world's smokers are
Chinese.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:22.380
For every $1,000 of music sold, the average
musician makes $23.40.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:28.130
If your stomach acid got on to your skin it
would burn a hole in it.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:33.750
Three-quarters of French people take their
annual holiday in France.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:40.190
Tokyo has three times as many Michelin-starred
restaurants as Paris.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:47.670
Many of the doves released at the opening
ceremony of the 1988 Seoul Olympics were accidentally

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:51.379
roasted alive when the Olympic flame was lit.

00:00:51.379 --> 00:00:57.720
During WWII the Russians built a tank that
could fly.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:03.239
One out of every 21 New Yorkers is a millionaire.

00:01:03.239 --> 00:01:09.050
Electrons move along an electricity cable
about as fast as honey flows.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:15.940
Before the Queen of England puts her shoes
on, a member of the royal household wears

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.550
them first to make sure they are comfortable
+.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:27.200
Every year, a thousand letters arrive in Jerusalem
addressed to God.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:35.380
Only three of the original 60 clauses of Magna
Carta are still in force.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:41.890
In Italy, 13 is not an unlucky number, but
17 is.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:47.420
The Netherlands exports more soy sauce than
Japan.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.200
Ants nod to each other as they pass.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:58.310
During the 1880s existed The Thirteen Club,
they formed to debunk the superstition surrounding

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:04.860
the number 13, during meetings they would
dine with 13 people at the table and spill

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.610
salt on Friday the 13th.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:16.000
The club has 5 US presidents as members, Chester
Arthur, Grover Cleveland, Benjamin Harrison,

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:22.230
William McKinley and Theodore Roosevelt.

